# This repository is public. Nothing below describes how the agent works —
# it is all personal course material, private notes, or local environment.
# Rule of thumb: system design (agent code, generalized skills, docs about the
# architecture) is tracked. Anything specific to one person's semester is not.

# ---- Personal course material ----
syllabi/
ongoing_processes/

# ---- Personal notes and documents ----
# Course content, transcripts, grades, advising/medical correspondence, drafts.
# TODO.md is the author's working list, not part of the shared design.
*.local.md
/TODO.md
personal/
notes/
documents/

# ---- User-supplied writing samples ----
# Each user drops their own samples here; the writing skill reads them to
# calibrate critique. The derived voicree profile is personal too. The folder
# shape and instructions are tracked so a fresh clone knows where they go.
writing_samples/*
!writing_samples/.gitkeep
!writing_samples/README.md

# ---- Per-course data ----
# One file per course: instructor, meeting times, grade weights, rubrics,
# deadlines, integrity clauses. The schema is tracked; the facts are not.
courses/*
!courses/EXAMPLE.md

# ---- Personal skill additions ----
# The skills themselves are method-only and tracked — they are the shareable
# part of this project. These are the private per-user extensions they read.
.claude/skills/**/local.md
.claude/skills/**/personal/

# ---- Local Claude Code config ----
# Whitelist, not blacklist: only skills are public. Claude Code accumulates
# local state here over time (agents, commands, session scratch), and an
# ignore-by-exception rule commits each new kind silently.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/settings.local.json

# ---- Python environment ----
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/

# ---- Secrets ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
credentials.json
token.json

# ---- Source documents dropped anywhere ----
# Syllabus PDFs, essay drafts, exports, graded returns, screenshots. syllabi/
# and writing_samples/ are already covered; this catches a stray Essay2.docx or
# a Gradescope screenshot at the repo root. Un-ignore docs/ assets when needed.
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc
*.pages
*.key
*.xlsx
*.csv
*.ipynb
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.heic
*.zip

# ---- Transcripts and grades ----
transcripts/
grades/
*.transcript.md

# ---- Database ----
# The schema is tracked (db/schema.sql); dumps and connection strings are not.
# The DSN lives in .env, already ignored above.
*.sql.gz
*.dump
pgdata/

# ---- OS / editor ----
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
